    "prompt": "Our on-call stipend is a fixed amount per week. Look it up with lookup_fact using the key 'oncall_stipend_usd', then tell me the total for 3 such weeks in a quarter. Use calculator on the value actually returned by lookup_fact. Return only the final number.",
